# Build context is the repo root (Dockerfile copies llama.cpp/ source).
# NOTE: llama.cpp/scripts/ must stay INCLUDED - the server's UI-provisioning
# step needs scripts/ui-assets.cmake at build time (dropping it fails the
# build with "Error processing file: .../scripts/ui-assets.cmake").
llama.cpp/.git
llama.cpp/build*
llama.cpp/models/
llama.cpp/.github/
llama.cpp/gguf-py/
llama.cpp/benches/
llama.cpp/pocs/
llama.cpp/tests/
llama.cpp/docs/
llama.cpp/**/node_modules
*.tar
*.tar.gz
